# Engineering Standards

Always-on conventions for AI coding agents in this repo. Keep it short and
imperative — everything here is in context on every relevant turn.

Rules that only apply to some files belong in `rules/*.md` with a `paths:`
list, not here.

## Universal

- <e.g. TypeScript `strict` on, no `any`, named exports only.>
- <e.g. Conventional Commits for every message.>
- <e.g. Errors: fail loud in dev, structured and logged in prod.>

